# Implementation Plan - Taskwarrior WebUI Enhancement

## Architecture & Tech Stack
- **Target Fork**: https://github.com/pplupo/taskwarrior-webui
- **Backend**: Node.js, Koa.js, TypeScript, taskwarrior-lib CLI wrapper.
- **Frontend**: Vue 2 (Composition API), Nuxt.js, Vuetify (Material Design), Vuex (typed-vuex).

## Proposed Architectural Modules

### 1. Backend Extensions (`backend/src/`)
- `GET /api/tasks/active`: Query active task status.
- `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/start` & `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/stop`: Direct timer management.
- `POST /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate` & `DELETE /api/tasks/:uuid/annotate`: Annotation management.
- `POST /api/tasks/undo` & `GET /api/tasks/undo/preview`: Undo operations preview and execution.
- `GET /api/config/queries`: Custom queries loader.
- `GET /api/reports/burndown` & `GET /api/reports/projects`: Progress metrics.

### 2. Frontend Components & Store (`frontend/`)
- Store additions: `activeTask`, `customQueries`, `undoPreview`, `activeViewMode` ('tasks' | 'kanban' | 'gantt'), `mnemonicsMap`.
- Keyboard & Mnemonic Engine (`plugins/hotkeys.ts`): Shortcut handlers (`Ctrl+Shift+K`, `n`, `t`, `q`, `u`, `s`, `g`) with visual red-box overlays.
- View Switcher: 3-way toggle between "Tasks" (Table), "Kanban" (Board), and "Gantt" (Timeline).
- Kanban View (`components/KanbanBoard.vue`, `components/KanbanCard.vue`): 4-column drag-and-drop layout (To Do, In Progress, Waiting, Done).
- Gantt Chart View (`components/GanttChart.vue`): 
  - Calendar date & duration resolution engine (`resolvedTaskDates`):
    - Primary: `task.start`; fallback: `task.due`; fallback: latest completion of prerequisite tasks (`task.depends`); fallback: today.
    - Inclusive duration spanning start to due date inclusive (or 1 day default).
  - Calendarless "Sequence" View mode (`props.zoom = 'Sequence'`):
    - Sequential step columns (`Step 1`, `Step 2`, ...) without calendar date labels.
    - Starts strictly on the day of the earliest task at column 0, eliminating past buffer.
  - 4-tier vertical task sorting engine (`sortedTasks`):
    - Priority (`H` > `M` > `L` > none) -> urgency -> dependents count -> alphabetical.
  - Real-time search filter engine (`localSearch`, `filteredTasks`):
    - Instant filter-as-you-type with debounced 2-way route query synchronization (`route.query.search`).
  - Fluid timeline width, zero empty intervals, and horizontal scroll engine (`colWidth`, `ResizeObserver`, `overflow-x: auto`):
    - Zero empty weeks/months: Week view bounds strictly from earliest task Monday to latest task Sunday; Month view bounds from 1st of earliest month to last day of latest month.
    - Minimum column width bounds (`140px` for Sequence/Day, `700px` for Week guaranteeing ~100px/day, `1500px` for Month guaranteeing ~50px/day) paired with fluid expansion `Math.max(minColWidth, distributed)` to fill wide viewports while maintaining wide inter-card channels and horizontal scroll on populated datasets.
  - Orthogonal non-overlapping multi-track SVG connector routing:
    - Dedicated vertical corridors across all zoom views preventing overlapping lines, line-to-line collisions (>2 lines per crossing), crossing through intermediate task cards/components, or continuing verticals past arrowheads.
    - Semicircular bridge hops (`A 4 4 0 0 0`) for crossing line segments.
  - Interactive Left/Right task bar anchor handles for linking dependencies via click/drag (bidirectional support: right source -> left target, or left source -> left target with cursor origin).
  - Hoverable SVG dependency arrow paths with stable, debounced clickable "X" buttons to remove dependencies (`task modify <uuid> depends:-<prereq>`).
- Widgets (`components/ActiveTaskBar.vue`, `components/UndoDialog.vue`, `components/CustomQueryBar.vue`, `components/ReportsView.vue`).

## Verification Strategy
- Backend API integration testing for timer and undo endpoints.
- Component rendering tests for Kanban board drag-and-drop.
- E2E keyboard shortcut validation.
